    title: 'Cloud Computing & DevOps: Building Scalable, Automated Infrastructure',
    excerpt: 'Explore cloud computing, AWS, Azure, Google Cloud, Docker, Kubernetes, CI/CD, Infrastructure as Code, cloud security and DevOps best practices.',
    serviceSlug: 'cloud-devops',
